//
// SRCHFOR: search a string in files (file list, option 3.4).
//
// The search string and its options are those of FIND (lib/findutil.js):
//   SRCHFOR string [WORD|PREFIX|SUFFIX] [col1 [col2]]     'two words'  c'Exact Case'
