// JavaScript port of the parsing logic of xmitviewer (GPL-3.0, Hanspe-3019):
//   https://github.com/Hanspe-3019/xmitviewer
//
// Layout of an XMIT file (TSO/E Customization, "Format of transmitted data"):
//   - a stream of segments: 1 byte length (header included), 1 byte flags
//       X'80' first segment of a record, X'40' last segment, X'20' control record
